    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="b9d50cbc-c64a-5916-9625-efcb91fe4bf1" activityNameId="55a2c8b1-b53a-5a5f-8626-ef8e72252191" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Glazing, triple (3-IV), U&lt;0.5 W/m2K, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Glazing, triple (3-IV), U&lt;0.5 W/m2K, at plant
This dataset describes the processes included in the production of 1.06m2 (corresponding to 1m2 visible area) triple glazing (3-IV) with a U-value below 0.5 W/m2K. It can be applied for triple glazing used in the building sector. 1 m2 visible glazing area has a final weight of 30 kg.;
UUID: 35905b76-be91-3d5f-bbc0-b6bf63b9071e
Included in this dataset are the materials and production processes of 1.06m2 (corresponding to 1m2 visible area) triple glazing (3-IV) with a U-value below 0.5 W/m2K including disposal of waste water and production wastes.
Location: Data estimated according to a European company.
Technology: The technology represents average European production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company documentation, calculations based on geometry 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that this dataset is representative for the whole Europe is taken into account in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_35905b76-be91-3d5f-bbc0-b6bf63b9071e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
